# Merge & Delivery

The `deliver` actor is the **only** thing that writes to Airtable. It reads source datasets, merges by 統編, filters to the qualified working set, then upserts.

## Merge (§6.1)
- Merge by `unifiedBusinessNo`. Exact match = same record.
- Registry sources win on firmographics; contact sources win **only** on `contact.*`.
- **Never overwrite `scoring.*`** or any human-owned field — those live in Airtable.
- Contact rows without 統編 (gmaps/gonghui) resolve via `matchConfidence`: auto-merge only ≥ 0.85, else queue for manual confirm. A low-confidence match must never clobber a registry field.
- Update `provenance.sources` and `lastRefreshed`; idempotent — re-running must not duplicate or clobber.

## Airtable (§9, Appendix A.3)
- Batch ≤ 10 records/request via `performUpsert` on `UnifiedBusinessNo`; sleep to stay under 5 req/sec per base.
- Keep the working set ≤ 1,000 rows (free-tier cap) — push only qualified rows; raw stays in Apify datasets.
- Write only firmographic/contact/signal fields. Exclude `Pain/Power/Will/Stage`; `Fit` is a formula field.
